{
  "title": "Jubilant Crispy Ethiopian Katsuobushi Hash",
  "description": "Rich and crispy Ethiopian dish featuring katsuobushi, temper, and macrobiotic-friendly ingredients, this hash is a comforting meal for any time of day.",
